00:02:28.533 --> 00:02:29.366
"Wait, maybe I got to take this thing

00:02:29.366 --> 00:02:30.199
"a little more seriously."

00:02:30.199 --> 00:02:31.483
And it becomes a maybe.

00:02:31.483 --> 00:02:32.458
And then it becomes a yes.

00:02:32.458 --> 00:02:33.718
And that's when the big growth thing is,

00:02:33.718 --> 00:02:36.219
